{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"54a008c64821647c1257721b967cfe8f7e90c2845071d48470660a3b48b98e35","ja":"秘密の舞台","zh":"秘密的舞台","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ce3df2bcc897d341cb9de4bcc7668da41d8dd935edfa7ee1d53c989593d18afc","ja":"ところで、伊織が持ってるのって、\nもしかして、台本？","zh":"说起来，伊织手里拿的那个，\n难道是剧本吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5d2ec02edcbbee9bde735a1f496fe96d509a029575dfe590fdc1caa021440ae1","ja":"ええ。今度、私が主演の舞台をやることになったの。\nこの後、本読みが入ってるから、目を通してたのよ。","zh":"嗯。下次我要主演一部舞台剧了。\n待会儿有剧本围读，所以我正在过目呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"239c001b7841d3cba7fa7250a998c2a974efbd410e62ff090d8be4bdc8e0c541","ja":"へぇ～！　すごいね、さすが伊織！\nどんな役なの？","zh":"诶～！好厉害，真不愧是伊织！\n是什么样的角色啊？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"af3ab297b06b8d757e4da219791f677946d42dfcf92fda8a9d5611b237c71862","ja":"そ、そうね……いろんな人の願いを叶える\n陽気な星の妖精、かしらね。","zh":"也、也是呢……会实现形形色色人们愿望的\n开朗的星星妖精，大概是这样吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f53dae972fed6c77707f983f6cff5b26850066efe154694f06c310090dbb7322","ja":"わぁ、面白そう！\nねえ、ちょっと演じて見せてもらってもいい？","zh":"哇，好像很有意思！\n那个，能稍微演给我看一下吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ccdc4cc16d45e1f60da8085bd1b91c60d008a5826e888bdc7d8646764f867aed","ja":"えっ！　そ、それはちょっと、恥ずかしい……。","zh":"诶！那、那样有点太不好意思了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"cca76285a051021e788945ea5a7a7f80d233d44fd0d879fd617bf16ba73a98e1","ja":"じゃなくて！　こ、困るわ！\nその……舞台監督が、ネタバレにうるさい人なのよ！","zh":"不是啦！会、会很让人为难的！\n那个……舞台监督是个对剧透很敏感的人啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"07dcd82a115a66f566b955049b46fcd29b8853e0352472dd6f0d49e693731399","ja":"だから……絶対ダメなの！","zh":"所以……绝对不行！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8d770830d91514e324559c5a990922bd430227c57337a1e93b43b8a6725b54dd","ja":"そっか～。それなら仕方ないね。","zh":"这样啊～。那就没办法了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"09dd8ff1367676a210a5a3510edb4ba5d5a29f9958b390066a4c3a0ab193f898","ja":"ええ、本当に。あ～あ、\n伊織ちゃんの演技を見せられなくて、残念だわ！","zh":"是啊，真的。哎～呀，\n没能让大家看到伊织的精湛演技，真遗憾呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e","ja":"数日後……","zh":"几天后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"79646e512a455f2dce433055b186fcf75ad3dc64178dabab141eed850e1dc8c3","ja":"（伊織、今日から立ち稽古が始まるって、\nすごく気合入ってたな～）","zh":"（伊织听说今天开始带动作排练，\n干劲十足呢～）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"84a3f9b493254a398a33abe00d90c980cc332f0478f6473ee2e326348711d20a","ja":"あれ？　ここにある台本って……。","zh":"咦？放在这里的剧本是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1491.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"72834b69fe361d4702da56fd3fb2e2ad6bbf1d38a7e2eba22c157fcb65646e37","ja":"ああっ！　やっぱり伊織の舞台のだ！！\n大変、急いで届けなきゃ！","zh":"啊啊！果然是伊织演舞台剧要用的！！\n糟了，得赶快送过去才行！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
